  "Single source of truth for audio asset IDs. Read by tools/ingest.mjs (budgets, loudness), apps/game/src/audio/files.ts (runtime) and tools/gen-audio-requests.mjs (docs/asset-requests/audio-*.md).",
  "Drop files as assets/incoming/audio/<id>_<nn>.<wav|mp3|m4a|flac|ogg> (nn = variant 01..), plus a license note next to it: <file name>.license.txt (e.g. sfx.hit_wood_01.wav.license.txt containing owner-created or CC0).",
  "runtime.sfx / amb / music = played by the game today when the file exists (synth fallback otherwise); runtime.pending = ingested and shipped but nothing plays it yet."
